title: DCShadow Rogue Domain Controller
id: dca89b8c-fa63-4695-a677-d98ea3ac7cb6
status: experimental
description: Detects DCShadow, where an attacker registers a rogue domain controller (nTDSDSA object creation / server registration in the Configuration partition via 5137) to push malicious directory changes without normal auditing.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1207/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 5137
    ObjectClass:
      - 'nTDSDSA'
      - 'server'
  condition: selection
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - IpAddress
falsepositives:
  - Legitimate domain controller promotion
level: critical
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1207
